    "darwin": "Opt+h Help  Ctrl+Opt+n New agent  Opt+Up Prev  Opt+Down Next  Opt+s Status  Opt+q Queries  Opt+1 Planners  Opt+2 Implementers  Ctrl+Opt+w Close  Ctrl+Opt+x Quit  Ctrl+Opt+r Restart  Ctrl+Opt+z Resize",
